return {hdroom0501={id="hdroom0501",name="北大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="小镇中心以北的大街。凹凸不平的青石板上雨水未干，几个孩童正脱了鞋袜在一旁踩水玩乐。几株嫩黄色的野花生在道路中央，躲过了车轴的碾压。两侧的柳树在春风的吹拂下十分婀娜，想必再过些时候柳絮纷飞，又是一番美景。",up="hdroom0547",down="hdroom0504",roomRoles={"hdnpc0501"},roomItems={"hdbs0501"},roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0502={id="hdroom0502",name="大街口",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="这里是两条街交汇之处。小贩们推着小车正四面吆喝。虽然元宵佳节已经过去了许久，但还是有不少孩童抱着鱼灯跑来跑去，一不小心撞上了几个看起来凶神恶煞的江湖壮汉，吓得直哭，反倒让那壮汉手足无措。",down="hdroom0507",left="hdroom0553",right="hdroom0503",roomRoles={"hdnpc0502"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0503={id="hdroom0503",name="北内大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="北内大街的内街。几个头戴草帽的江湖客站在道旁打量着周围的环境，默不作声。远处一只风筝不知为何断了线，落在了屋檐之上，几个少女争相打闹，正烦恼要如何将风筝取下。",left="hdroom0502",right="hdroom0504",roomRoles={"hdnpc0503"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",condition