={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0507={id="hdroom0507",name="西内大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="西大街的内街。诸多屋舍院门敞开，妇人们多站在庭前和面，不时谈笑几句。远处守门的黄狗卧躺在地上，见到邻里也不吠叫，只一个劲儿地摇着尾巴。两个迷路的货商走了过来，正敲门问路，后头马车里运着不少好东西。",up="hdroom0502",down="hdroom0511",roomRoles={"hdnpc0507"},roomItems={"hdbs0503"},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0508={id="hdroom0508",name="北大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="小镇中心以北的大街。凹凸不平的青石板上雨水未干，几个孩童正脱了鞋袜在一旁踩水玩乐。几株嫩黄色的野花生在道路中央，躲过了车轴的碾压。两侧的柳树在春风的吹拂下十分婀娜，想必再过些时候柳絮纷飞，又是一番美景。",up="hdroom0504",down="hdroom0512",roomRoles={"hdnpc0508"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0509={id="hdroom0509",name="比武台",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="这里是比武的擂台。擂台上缚着红色的绸带，两侧立有木牌，写着擂主与打擂之人的名号。一桌赌席开在左侧，又有庄家吆喝着买定离手。几个江湖草莽蓄势待发，正松快着筋骨准备走上擂台。",up="hdroom0505",roomRoles={},roomItems={"hdbs0504"},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},au