d="hdroom0515",name="平安大街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="这里是小镇的正大街。只微微抬头便能看到漫天的纸鸢，两侧屋舍二楼有不少人家木窗半开，在窗边置上一桌酒席，三四碟小菜，齐聚一堂。偶有几个江湖侠客抬着一壶好酒，就坐在屋脊上，悄悄欣赏着镇中美景。",down="hdroom0548",left="hdroom0544",right="hdroom0516",roomRoles={"hdnpc0513"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0516={id="hdroom0516",name="平安西街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="中央广场西面的大街，往东便是中央广场。炎炎夏日，原本热闹的街道安静了不少，走在街上能听到人们来来往往的脚步声。几个村民提着水桶朝着水井走去，不多时从里面拉出了一盆蔬果，孩子们都围了上去。这是百姓夏日专门用于“冰镇”的法子，比不得高门大户的冰窖，却也能消暑自乐。",up="hdroom0511",left="hdroom0515",right="hdroom0517",roomRoles={"hdnpc0514"},roomItems={},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={}},hdroom0517={id="hdroom0517",name="平安西街",permission=1,mapHide="0",dsc="中央广场西面的大街，往东便是中央广场。炎炎夏日，原本热闹的街道安静了不少，走在街上能听到人们来来往往的脚步声。几个村民提着水桶朝着水井走去，不多时从里面拉出了一盆蔬果，孩子们都围了上去。这是百姓夏日专门用于“冰镇”的法子，比不得高门大户的冰窖，却也能消暑自乐。",down="hdroom0523",left="hdroom0516",right="hdroom0518",roomRoles={"hdnpc0515","hdnpc0516"},roomItems={"hdbs0509"},BgmDown="1",roomBgm="mache",roomBgmRule=2,stepMusic="jiaobu",fightBackground="城镇室外",autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditio